Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------TEXT-------------------
Comment: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:07.24,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,前辈一点也没有晒黑呢
Comment: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:08.95,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,篠崎先生 你听好了！
Comment: 0,0:00:08.95,0:00:11.28,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,这不是「没晒黑」
Comment: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:13.53,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,而是「努力避免晒黑」了！
Comment: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:15.87,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,这可是我的努力成果呢
Comment: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:17.58,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 对不起…
Comment: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.75,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,前辈的肌肤
Comment: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:20.54,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,总是那么得白皙漂亮呢
Comment: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.50,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,漂  漂亮什么的…
Comment: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.79,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,不用那样说我也是懂的！
Comment: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:25.71,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 不是！
Comment: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:26.84,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,我并没有那种意思！
Comment: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:28.76,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,那 究竟是什么意思呢？
Comment: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.55,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,观 观众的提问环节
Comment: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.47,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,我们开始吧！
Comment: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.76,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的 得注意了…
Comment: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:38.23,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,像皮肤毛病啊 表皮干燥啊
Comment: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:40.39,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是难免会出现的呢…  
Comment: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:43.27,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,讨厌的皮肤老化…
Comment: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:45.73,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,体重也容易增长了…
Comment: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:48.74,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 在这方面也是能感受到的呢
Comment: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:50.32,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是辛苦…
Comment: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:52.57,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,没什么好的变化吗？
Comment: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:55.78,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,能用自己工作赚来的钱
Comment: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:57.79,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,买到自己想要的东西
Comment: 0,0:00:57.79,0:00:59.79,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,或者去想去的地方
Comment: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:01.00,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,之类的
Comment: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.17,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,那样自由自在的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.50,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,仿佛在说「我也成为一个独立的大人了」
Comment: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:06.88,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是这么想的
Comment: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.01,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,自食其力者无所不能！
Comment: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:11.59,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,产生此感的时候 真好啊
Comment: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:13.18,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,还 还有就是…
Comment: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:15.39,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,喜 喜欢的人跟…
Comment: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:16.85,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,不 不行！
Comment: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:18.89,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,从这里开始就是隐私了！
Comment: 0,0:01:18.89,0:01:20.14,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,不愧是前辈
Comment: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.81,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,真 真是成熟呢
Comment: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:22.85,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,是关于什么内容的…
Comment: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:25.85,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,嘻嘻…是秘密哦
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------FX-------------------
